WEBVTT

00:36.935 --> 00:39.165
Block 2 Pictures


00:41.472 --> 00:42.832
Present


00:43.041 --> 00:45.031
A Jet Tone Films Production


00:46.544 --> 00:48.514
IN THE MOOD FOR LOVE


00:48.713 --> 00:49.833
Starring


00:50.048 --> 00:51.378
Maggie Cheung Man-Yuk


00:51.582 --> 00:52.912
Tony Leung Chiu-Wai


00:53.117 --> 00:54.277
Directed by


00:54.485 --> 00:55.855
Wong Kar-Wai


00:59.324 --> 01:00.384
It is a restless moment.


01:00.591 --> 01:02.321
She has kept her head lowered...


01:02.427 --> 01:04.087
to give him a chance to come closer.


01:04.195 --> 01:05.825
But he could not, for lack of courage.


01:05.930 --> 01:07.550
She turns and walks away.


01:08.599 --> 01:10.769
HONG KONG, 1962.


01:15.473 --> 01:17.403
Eat up. The fish is very fresh today.


01:24.215 --> 01:25.945
Sorry to interrupt your dinner.


01:26.150 --> 01:28.240
Never mind. Let's sit over here.


01:30.722 --> 01:32.482
It's quite late!


01:32.857 --> 01:34.487
I've just finished work.


01:35.360 --> 01:36.690
What should I call you?


01:36.894 --> 01:38.414
You can call me Mrs. Suen.


01:38.629 --> 01:40.469
- And you?
- My husband's name is Chan.


01:40.631 --> 01:43.421
- Call me when you decide.
- I will.


01:44.002 --> 01:45.622
Did you write down my number?


01:45.937 --> 01:46.967
Yes, I did.


01:47.205 --> 01:48.835
Fine, I'll see you out.


01:49.040 --> 01:50.660
- Don't trouble.
- No trouble!


02:02.020 --> 02:03.410
So it's agreed then!


02:03.621 --> 02:04.951
Thank you very much! I should go.


02:05.156 --> 02:06.086
- Fine.
- Bye!


02:06.290 --> 02:07.620
Take care. Good-bye!


02:09.127 --> 02:10.757
You've a room to let?


02:10.962 --> 02:14.652
Sorry, it's just been rented
to that lady.


02:15.233 --> 02:16.293
Thanks anyway.


02:16.501 --> 02:18.431
How many of you?


02:19.203 --> 02:20.863
Just me and my wife.


02:21.572 --> 02:23.162
Why don't you try next door?


02:23.408 --> 02:25.308
They've a vacant room too?


02:25.543 --> 02:30.343
Yes, Mr. Koo's son got married.
His room's empty.


02:30.982 --> 02:31.882
Thank you.


02:32.083 --> 02:33.813
You're too polite. Try asking them.


02:34.018 --> 02:34.958
Thank you.


02:41.559 --> 02:42.659
This way. Come on.


02:42.860 --> 02:44.020
Not that room!


02:44.262 --> 02:45.992
Oops, wrong again!


02:49.567 --> 02:51.297
Careful! Against the wall there.


02:57.708 --> 02:59.198
The little cupboard over there.


02:59.410 --> 03:00.570
Be careful!


03:01.546 --> 03:03.176
Don't break anything!


03:03.414 --> 03:05.384
Not on top of the radio!


03:06.084 --> 03:06.884
Mr. Chow...


03:07.085 --> 03:09.175
you have a lot of stuff for a couple!


03:09.921 --> 03:11.981
- The wardrobe isn't mine.
- Wrong again?


03:12.190 --> 03:13.380
It goes next door.


03:13.591 --> 03:15.581
Okay, next door.


03:16.094 --> 03:20.034
These aren't my shoes!
They must go next door.


03:22.033 --> 03:24.723
What a coincidence!
Moving in on the same day!


03:25.470 --> 03:27.190
Is Mr. Chan here?


03:27.572 --> 03:30.262
He's working abroad.
He'll be back next week.


03:30.942 --> 03:33.032
You should have waited, then.


03:33.644 --> 03:36.204
It's too much for you on your own.


03:36.481 --> 03:39.041
- I can manage.
- I'll ask Amah to help.


03:39.250 --> 03:41.010
No need. I can manage.


03:41.219 --> 03:42.749
What's going on?


03:43.988 --> 03:45.048
Mind that mirror!


03:45.256 --> 03:46.886
Mrs. Chan, I'll leave you to it.


03:53.965 --> 03:56.225
- Those books aren't mine.
- Wrong again?


03:56.434 --> 03:57.864
Never mind. Just leave them there.


03:58.469 --> 04:00.639
Mind how you hang the mirror.
It's fragile!


04:00.838 --> 04:02.468
Are these magazines yours?


04:03.508 --> 04:05.408
Yes, they're my husband's.


04:05.843 --> 04:07.473
He reads Japanese?


04:07.745 --> 04:09.615
A little. His boss is Japanese.


04:09.814 --> 04:11.374
How should I address you?


04:11.582 --> 04:12.642
My husband's name is Chan.


04:12.917 --> 04:14.547
My name's Chow.
I'll leave you in peace.


04:14.752 --> 04:15.982
Thank you, Mr. Chow.


04:16.187 --> 04:17.247
Don't mention it.


04:20.158 --> 04:21.648
I'll ask Mrs. Chan.


04:24.795 --> 04:26.995
Mrs. Chan,
eat with us before you go!


04:27.231 --> 04:30.091
No, thanks.
I must dash to the airport.


04:30.368 --> 04:32.138
- Your husband's coming back?
- Yes.


04:32.336 --> 04:33.996
Then I won't keep you.


04:36.007 --> 04:37.637
- Going out?
- Yes.


04:40.211 --> 04:41.371
Sorry I'm late!


04:41.646 --> 04:42.876
Amah, pour some beer.


04:44.849 --> 04:45.819
Cheers!


04:47.351 --> 04:50.441
Mrs. Chow,
try some Shanghai dishes.


04:50.922 --> 04:53.612
Where is Mrs. Chan off to so late?


04:55.059 --> 04:57.359
Meeting her husband at the airport.


04:57.862 --> 04:59.482
So that's why she looks different.


05:58.155 --> 06:00.555
It's all packed.
Take care on your trip.


06:01.058 --> 06:02.028
I will.


06:05.496 --> 06:08.056
How long this time?


06:08.399 --> 06:10.299
Two to four weeks.


06:11.102 --> 06:15.232
Remember to bring back
two more of those handbags.


06:15.573 --> 06:16.563
Who for?


06:16.774 --> 06:17.794
My boss.


06:18.009 --> 06:19.139
Two of them?


06:19.477 --> 06:21.037
You know why.


06:21.245 --> 06:22.875
Different colors?


06:24.248 --> 06:26.278
The same will do! Who cares?


06:27.351 --> 06:28.641
Whatever!


06:39.797 --> 06:45.167
Mrs. Ho.
Mr. Ho is still in a meeting.


06:45.369 --> 06:48.139
He'll be home late.
Please don't wait to eat.


06:51.175 --> 06:53.235
Yes. We're so busy at the moment.


06:54.845 --> 06:57.785
Yes. I'll ask him to call you
when he gets back.


07:06.724 --> 07:08.454
Did you call my wife?


07:08.659 --> 07:10.959
Yes, I said you'd be back later.


07:11.896 --> 07:13.326
Have you booked the restaurant?


07:13.531 --> 07:14.691
A table for two at 8:00.


07:15.299 --> 07:18.209
Miss Yu called
to say she's on her way.


07:18.969 --> 07:23.499
I'll be back after dinner.
Can I bring you something?


07:23.708 --> 07:25.938
No, thanks. I'll get my own.


07:26.977 --> 07:31.177
Leave when you're ready.
I'll lock up.


07:35.486 --> 07:37.286
- Good evening, Mr. Ho!
- Evening!


07:56.240 --> 07:58.530
- Going out, Mrs. Chan?
- Yes.


08:02.913 --> 08:04.543
Going out so late?


08:04.749 --> 08:06.379
Just getting some noodles.


08:06.851 --> 08:09.251
Amah is making pork soup. Join us.


08:09.453 --> 08:12.473
Thanks, I'm not really hungry.
I just want some air.


08:12.690 --> 08:14.680
You're too polite.


08:14.892 --> 08:16.182
Next time!


08:19.230 --> 08:22.850
They're all starving. We can eat.


08:25.069 --> 08:26.699
Have you spoken to Ming?


08:28.205 --> 08:29.865
So I'll go with someone else!


08:31.642 --> 08:33.402
Just kidding!


08:33.944 --> 08:36.874
I'll be early tonight. See you soon!


08:45.256 --> 08:46.226
Chow!


08:46.590 --> 08:47.550
Coming!


08:54.064 --> 08:58.694
Time to go! Finish it tomorrow!


08:59.136 --> 09:01.466
No, I'm nearly there.


09:01.772 --> 09:02.862
Oh, Ming.


09:03.808 --> 09:06.438
- I need a few days off next month.
- Why?


09:07.344 --> 09:10.374
I promised my wife a trip.
Put in a word for me, will you?


09:11.081 --> 09:13.641
I'll speak to personnel.


09:13.851 --> 09:15.811
But the next lunch is on you.


09:16.020 --> 09:17.110
I will.


09:17.488 --> 09:18.648
Thanks, Ming!


09:21.459 --> 09:22.619
It's ready!


09:22.993 --> 09:25.223
No, it'll switch itself off!.


09:26.797 --> 09:28.897
I told you, it's not ready!


09:30.000 --> 09:32.790
A rice cooker!
It's yours, Mrs. Koo?


09:33.304 --> 09:37.334
No, it's beyond us!
It's Mrs. Chan's.


09:40.444 --> 09:41.934
My husband brought it from Japan.


09:42.146 --> 09:43.906
I wanted to show Mrs. Koo
how good it is.


09:44.682 --> 09:45.972
Now it's ready!


09:56.227 --> 10:00.857
Mrs. Chan, could Mr. Chan
get me one next time?


10:01.065 --> 10:02.155
No problem!


10:02.666 --> 10:05.326
Mr. Chow, you should get one too!


10:05.636 --> 10:09.366
Your wife's so often late home.


10:11.242 --> 10:12.972
I couldn't trouble Mr. Chan.


10:13.210 --> 10:15.140
It's just neighborly, isn't it?


10:16.680 --> 10:19.870
It's no trouble!
I'll ask him to buy another next time.


10:20.684 --> 10:21.944
Thank you!


10:31.161 --> 10:33.721
Let's try the rice.


10:35.533 --> 10:38.503
Mr. Chan, sorry to trouble you
about the rice cooker.


10:38.702 --> 10:40.362
It was really no trouble.


10:41.839 --> 10:44.369
How much do I owe you?


10:44.742 --> 10:46.402
Your wife has already paid me.


10:46.777 --> 10:47.747
Really?


10:47.945 --> 10:49.645
She didn't tell you?


10:50.180 --> 10:51.700
She's been working late shifts.


10:51.916 --> 10:53.906
Often I'm asleep when she gets back.


10:54.118 --> 10:55.678
It must be hard for her.


10:55.920 --> 10:56.850
Yes.


10:57.421 --> 10:59.011
Mrs. Chan isn't back yet?


10:59.223 --> 11:02.353
She'll be back soon.
You need to talk to her?


11:02.893 --> 11:04.753
A friend needs to go to Singapore.


11:04.962 --> 11:07.482
I wonder if she could get
a cheap ticket for him.


11:07.698 --> 11:09.228
I'll ask when she gets back.


11:10.701 --> 11:12.601
I'm bothering you too much.


11:12.803 --> 11:15.673
Don't mention it. We're neighbors!


11:16.574 --> 11:18.264
I'll leave you in peace.


11:24.715 --> 11:25.905
Looking for me?


11:26.216 --> 11:29.116
Damn right. Where've you been?


11:29.787 --> 11:31.017
What's up?


11:31.722 --> 11:35.622
Mrs. Chan called.
You left a hat at her office.


11:35.826 --> 11:38.626
I meant to!
I wanted an excuse to go back.


11:39.096 --> 11:40.726
I know your tricks!


11:41.932 --> 11:43.362
She's married.


11:43.601 --> 11:45.531
I know, that's why I left.


11:45.736 --> 11:48.726
Otherwise I'd move in next door.


11:48.939 --> 11:52.709
If your wife wasn't so attractive,
she'd be a worried woman!


11:55.579 --> 11:57.209
I'm not like you.


11:59.416 --> 12:01.146
Please call Mrs. Chan for me.


12:01.585 --> 12:02.985
I'll pick up the hat tomorrow.


12:03.187 --> 12:04.557
And take her to lunch!


12:05.422 --> 12:06.542
Dream on!


12:06.757 --> 12:09.597
She'll take the hat home.
I'll bring it in tomorrow.


12:10.461 --> 12:13.121
You're kidding!
Some buddy you are!


12:13.330 --> 12:15.450
Tell you what,
let's go pick her up now!


12:17.301 --> 12:19.821
She should be off work by now.
We can go together!


12:20.471 --> 12:21.991
I don't have time for this.


12:22.206 --> 12:23.136
Chow!


12:23.340 --> 12:25.900
Yes! Get out of here, I'm busy.


12:26.143 --> 12:28.833
Then I'll wait at your place.


12:30.547 --> 12:31.847
Ping!


12:40.157 --> 12:41.927
Mr. Chow, is Mr. Koo in?


12:42.226 --> 12:45.126
He's out...
Forgot to buy the paper again?


12:45.396 --> 12:46.766
That's right, I'll stop by later.


12:46.964 --> 12:49.194
- Maybe I can find it for you.
- Thank you.


13:00.244 --> 13:01.934
- This one?
- Yes.


13:03.313 --> 13:06.803
I always loved those serials.
Hated to miss an episode.


13:07.084 --> 13:08.774
Really? You liked them too?


13:08.919 --> 13:12.379
I even thought of writing one!


13:12.823 --> 13:14.223
Why didn't you?


13:14.558 --> 13:16.858
I couldn't get started,
so I gave up.


13:17.194 --> 13:19.354
I wasn't born
to write martial arts stories!


13:19.563 --> 13:21.823
But you can borrow
from my collection anytime.


13:22.032 --> 13:25.022
Not now. Maybe another time.
Thanks.


13:25.235 --> 13:26.205
You're welcome!


13:34.044 --> 13:35.674
What is it? Mrs. Chan!


13:36.380 --> 13:38.570
I just want to return these
to Mr. Chow. Is he in?


13:38.882 --> 13:40.852
He's been away for a few days.


13:41.051 --> 13:41.981
Why?


13:42.619 --> 13:44.249
They had a quarrel.


13:44.955 --> 13:49.325
Leave them with me.
I'll pass them back to him.


13:50.360 --> 13:51.320
Thank you.


14:00.070 --> 14:01.160
Forget it!


14:02.106 --> 14:04.876
I'm on a replacement shift tonight.


14:06.977 --> 14:08.607
Talk to you later.


14:12.783 --> 14:14.413
No need to pick me up!


14:17.387 --> 14:19.017
She's already left.


14:19.823 --> 14:23.053
Really? I was going
to take her out for supper.


14:23.761 --> 14:26.421
Didn't she tell you
she was off early today?


14:26.764 --> 14:29.354
She never remembers to tell me.


14:31.468 --> 14:33.198
Maybe she's home by now.


14:34.271 --> 14:35.431
I'll be off, then.


14:35.639 --> 14:36.869
Okay, bye!


17:01.251 --> 17:02.181
Hello!


17:14.998 --> 17:16.198
You're out of hospital!


17:16.400 --> 17:18.960
Don't mention hospital!
Lend me $30!


17:19.403 --> 17:20.373
What for?


17:20.737 --> 17:22.727
You gotta help me save face!


17:22.940 --> 17:24.030
What's the big deal?


17:24.241 --> 17:25.931
It's Ah Hoi's fault.


17:26.143 --> 17:29.233
He gave me a racing tip,
said it was a sure thing.


17:29.980 --> 17:34.210
Before they'd taken out the stitches...


17:34.418 --> 17:36.718
I bet everything I had.


17:36.920 --> 17:38.540
And I lost my shirt!


17:38.855 --> 17:40.615
What did you expect?


17:41.358 --> 17:43.728
I thought it was my lucky day.


17:43.961 --> 17:45.651
Anyhow, I had only $2 left.


17:46.330 --> 17:49.660
So I went to the whorehouse.


17:50.033 --> 17:51.963
You were in no shape for sex!


17:52.169 --> 17:54.169
I thought it would improve my luck.


17:56.173 --> 17:58.643
What would $2 buy you?


17:59.676 --> 18:03.116
I'm Kwai-fei's regular.
She gives me credit.


18:03.947 --> 18:05.277
You can have it on credit?


18:05.482 --> 18:08.972
I left my I D card and said
I'd be back to redeem it.


18:09.486 --> 18:11.816
I thought a few dollars
would be easy to rustle up.


18:12.189 --> 18:14.289
But so far nothing.
I'm way overdue.


18:14.491 --> 18:15.111
So?


18:15.459 --> 18:17.299
Four Eyes was there yesterday.


18:17.494 --> 18:19.864
Saw her waving my I D
around in front of everyone.


18:20.063 --> 18:21.323
So embarrassing!


18:21.665 --> 18:23.295
Anyway, lend me $30!


18:29.806 --> 18:31.436
This is all I can spare.


18:32.209 --> 18:34.549
I need $10 for myself.


18:37.414 --> 18:39.104
Pay you back next month.


18:39.983 --> 18:42.213
- Let's have a late snack.
- What?


18:42.519 --> 18:45.489
All I've had today
is some won-ton noodles.


18:45.722 --> 18:47.382
Let me finish writing this first.


18:50.861 --> 18:52.821
I'm not sure
I should tell you this--


18:53.663 --> 18:54.563
What?


18:54.765 --> 18:57.235
I saw your wife
in the street yesterday.


18:57.534 --> 18:59.164
So what?


19:00.570 --> 19:03.830
She was with some guy.


19:08.545 --> 19:10.175
Probably a friend.


19:12.549 --> 19:14.919
Just thought you should know.


19:21.191 --> 19:24.781
Mr. Ho's still in a meeting.
He says he can't manage dinner.


19:26.997 --> 19:29.027
Yes, we're very busy now.


19:33.103 --> 19:34.193
I will.


19:34.938 --> 19:36.878
I'll ask Mr. Ho to call.


19:42.512 --> 19:44.812
- Have you called Miss Yu?
- Yes, I have.


19:45.515 --> 19:46.485
What did she say?


19:46.683 --> 19:48.583
Asks you to call her later.


19:48.785 --> 19:51.415
And Mrs. Ho says she's ready
to cut her birthday cake.


19:51.621 --> 19:52.881
She wants you to hurry home.


19:53.090 --> 19:55.580
- Did you get me a present for her?
- Yes, this.


19:55.792 --> 19:57.652
- What is it?
- A scarf.


19:58.128 --> 20:00.828
- I think Mrs. Ho will like it.
- Thank you.


20:01.398 --> 20:02.728
And here's your change.


20:02.933 --> 20:06.393
I'm always troubling you.
Use it for bus fare.


20:06.970 --> 20:09.560
Why don't you dine with us tonight?


20:09.806 --> 20:12.776
Thank you, I've already
planned to see a film tonight.


20:12.976 --> 20:14.676
Then I won't keep you.


20:14.945 --> 20:17.845
Tomorrow will be quiet.
Take the morning off.


20:28.225 --> 20:29.855
Are you going out tonight?


20:32.329 --> 20:34.059
Don't forget your keys.


20:34.264 --> 20:36.524
All the neighbors
are dining out tonight.


20:37.167 --> 20:40.867
I have a lot to do here.
I'll be late.


20:56.253 --> 20:57.883
What is it, Mrs. Chan?


20:58.288 --> 20:59.448
I heard voices,


20:59.656 --> 21:01.926
I thought Mr. and Mrs. Koo
were back.


21:02.325 --> 21:05.155
Not yet. Anything I can help with?


21:06.930 --> 21:09.290
No, I just wanted a chat.


21:10.433 --> 21:12.493
- Are you alone?
- Yes, I am.


21:16.039 --> 21:17.739
You're back early today!


21:18.441 --> 21:21.301
I came back to rest.
I'm not feeling well...


21:23.446 --> 21:25.976
What is it?
I have some medicines...


21:26.950 --> 21:29.510
Don't trouble yourself,
I'll sleep it off.


21:31.888 --> 21:33.948
In that case...
I'll leave you in peace.


21:40.130 --> 21:41.750
It was your wife.


21:44.501 --> 21:46.261
Have you spoken to your wife yet?


21:47.571 --> 21:49.431
Then we shouldn't meet anymore.


22:37.087 --> 22:38.747
Any news from the Philippines?


22:39.222 --> 22:40.342
Yes, a telex.


22:40.557 --> 22:42.497
There's a typhoon,
so the ship's still docked.


22:43.293 --> 22:48.163
Please inform Chan
that the shipment may be delayed.


22:48.565 --> 22:50.195
Ask if that's a problem.


22:53.903 --> 22:56.893
Your wife rang.
You don't need to pick her up.


22:57.107 --> 22:58.767
She's playing mahjong with Mrs. Lau.


22:58.975 --> 23:01.205
She'll meet you
at the restaurant at 5.30.


23:04.881 --> 23:06.431
And there's a gift from Miss Yu.


23:06.883 --> 23:08.183
She was here?


23:08.385 --> 23:10.115
No, she had it sent over.


23:10.387 --> 23:13.557
She says she'll dine alone
since it's your birthday.


23:13.990 --> 23:16.350
Please phone her
when you have a moment.


23:18.461 --> 23:20.951
- I'll get you another coffee.
- Thank you.


23:44.254 --> 23:45.314
Thank you.


23:51.027 --> 23:52.657
That tie looks good on you.


23:53.263 --> 23:57.493
You noticed?
It's much like the old one.


23:59.102 --> 24:01.432
You notice things
if you pay attention.


24:13.817 --> 24:15.077
I'll be off now.


24:15.285 --> 24:18.485
If Chan has a problem,
let me know at the restaurant.


24:18.688 --> 24:19.348
I will.


24:19.556 --> 24:20.816
Why did you change your tie?


24:21.024 --> 24:22.684
The new one was too showy.


24:22.892 --> 24:24.582
I should stick with my own.


24:24.794 --> 24:26.454
Don't forget to lock up.


26:13.336 --> 26:16.236
By the way,
haven't seen your husband lately.


26:17.140 --> 26:19.730
He's abroad now,
on company business.


26:20.243 --> 26:22.803
That's why I see you
at the noodle stall.


26:24.113 --> 26:25.803
I don't like cooking for myself.


26:27.016 --> 26:29.386
Haven't seen your wife
lately either.


26:30.420 --> 26:33.410
Her mother's ill.
She's at home with her.


26:35.091 --> 26:36.781
That explains it.


26:37.694 --> 26:38.824
Good night!


26:39.496 --> 26:40.326
Good night!


26:40.964 --> 26:42.594
Mrs. Chan, I'm glad you're back!


26:42.799 --> 26:44.569
It's raining so hard!


26:44.767 --> 26:46.667
I was going to look for you
with an umbrella.


26:47.136 --> 26:48.106
You're too kind.


26:48.304 --> 26:49.494
Amah, who is it?


26:49.606 --> 26:50.366
It's Mrs. Chan.


26:50.473 --> 26:51.403
Mrs. Suen!


26:52.008 --> 26:56.308
Caught in the rain?
I said you could eat with us!


26:57.180 --> 26:59.340
Next time... Enjoy your game.


27:01.784 --> 27:06.614
Her husband's always away.
It's sad to see her so lonely.


27:06.823 --> 27:10.853
She dresses up like that
to go out for noodles?


27:21.738 --> 27:23.938
Mr. Chow!
What are you doing here?


27:24.574 --> 27:26.434
Just calling Mrs. Koo to the phone.


27:28.077 --> 27:29.707
You're late back.


27:29.979 --> 27:31.679
I went to the pictures.


27:32.315 --> 27:33.945
I'll be going.


27:41.324 --> 27:42.344
Hello?


27:43.159 --> 27:44.789
Yes, please hold on.


27:45.028 --> 27:47.058
- Who is it?
- It's for Mrs. Chan.


27:58.074 --> 28:01.844
It must seem odd to ask you out,
but I want to ask something.


28:02.245 --> 28:04.505
That handbag I saw you with
this evening...


28:04.714 --> 28:06.144
Where did you buy it?


28:07.250 --> 28:08.910
Why do you ask?


28:10.920 --> 28:13.980
It looked so elegant.
I want to get one for my wife.


28:17.293 --> 28:19.223
Mr. Chow, you're so good
to your wife!


28:20.396 --> 28:23.696
Not really! My wife is so fussy.


28:24.067 --> 28:27.167
Her birthday is some days away.
I don't know what to get her.


28:31.975 --> 28:34.205
Could you buy one
for me to give her?


28:35.144 --> 28:38.444
Maybe she wouldn't want one
just exactly the same.


28:40.583 --> 28:43.013
You're right, I didn't think of that.


28:44.654 --> 28:46.284
A woman would mind.


28:46.723 --> 28:49.523
Yes, especially since
we're neighbors.


28:52.328 --> 28:54.098
Do they come in other colors?


28:56.766 --> 28:58.736
I'd have to ask my husband.


28:59.435 --> 29:00.455
Why?


29:01.471 --> 29:04.631
He bought it for me
on a business trip abroad.


29:05.241 --> 29:06.901
They aren't on sale here.


29:10.947 --> 29:12.437
Then never mind.


29:19.322 --> 29:20.282
Actually...


29:20.490 --> 29:22.580
I want to ask you something too.


29:24.694 --> 29:25.554
What?


29:26.996 --> 29:28.626
Where did you buy your tie?


29:31.634 --> 29:33.294
I don't know where it came from.


29:33.703 --> 29:35.933
My wife buys all my ties.


29:36.539 --> 29:37.599
Really?


29:40.143 --> 29:45.603
She bought this one
on a business trip abroad.


29:46.115 --> 29:47.745
It's not on sale here.


29:49.118 --> 29:50.818
What a coincidence!


29:53.556 --> 29:54.526
Yes.


30:00.730 --> 30:02.020
Actually...


30:04.400 --> 30:07.160
my husband has one just like it.


30:08.371 --> 30:10.431
He said it was a gift from his boss.


30:11.007 --> 30:12.707
So he wears it every day.


30:17.914 --> 30:20.214
And my wife has a bag
just like yours.


30:21.417 --> 30:22.857
I know,


30:23.052 --> 30:24.172
I've seen it.


30:26.823 --> 30:28.953
What are you getting at, actually?


30:41.204 --> 30:43.504
I thought I was the only one
who knew.


31:02.425 --> 31:04.325
I wonder how it began.


31:20.443 --> 31:23.933
It's late.
Won't your wife complain?


31:24.947 --> 31:28.007
She's used to it. She doesn't care.


31:30.553 --> 31:31.853
And your husband?


31:32.655 --> 31:34.625
He must be asleep by now.


31:38.227 --> 31:39.957
Shall we stay out tonight?


31:47.637 --> 31:49.627
My husband would never say that.


31:52.608 --> 31:54.268
What would he say?


31:54.911 --> 31:57.141
Anyhow, he wouldn't say that.


31:57.980 --> 31:59.770
Someone must have made
the first move.


32:00.416 --> 32:02.116
Who else could it be?


32:07.590 --> 32:10.580
It's late.
Won't your wife complain?


32:11.360 --> 32:13.920
She's used to it. She doesn't care.


32:15.364 --> 32:16.954
And your husband?


32:17.834 --> 32:19.824
He must be asleep by now.


32:41.457 --> 32:43.117
I can't say it.


32:47.530 --> 32:49.150
I understand.


32:51.500 --> 32:53.490
After all, it's already happened.


32:54.170 --> 32:56.530
It doesn't matter
who made the first move.


33:00.810 --> 33:02.640
Do you really know your wife?


33:32.775 --> 33:34.365
You order for me.


33:34.877 --> 33:35.847
Why?


33:39.782 --> 33:42.082
I've no idea what your wife likes.


33:52.628 --> 33:54.498
What about your husband?


34:35.972 --> 34:37.032
Like it hot?


34:41.310 --> 34:43.070
Your wife likes hot dishes.


35:11.674 --> 35:14.004
Why did you call me
at the office today?


35:18.981 --> 35:21.911
I had nothing to do.
I wanted to hear your voice.


35:27.023 --> 35:28.823
You have my husband down pat.


35:29.025 --> 35:30.655
He's a real sweet-talker.


35:57.520 --> 35:59.180
Why didn't you call me today?


36:00.389 --> 36:02.449
I was afraid you won't like it.


36:04.260 --> 36:06.220
Then don't call me again.


36:22.344 --> 36:24.674
Mrs. Chan!
A letter from your husband.


36:27.616 --> 36:29.916
It's not for me,
it's for Mr. Chow next door.


36:30.119 --> 36:34.419
The Japanese stamp made me think
it was your husband.


36:35.291 --> 36:36.911
So I was wrong.


36:53.542 --> 36:55.162
Your wife's in Japan?


36:57.213 --> 36:58.543
How did you know?


37:01.050 --> 37:02.710
What did she say in her letter?


37:03.419 --> 37:04.689
Nothing special.


37:06.822 --> 37:08.552
Anything about
when she'd be back?


37:10.392 --> 37:11.252
No.


37:12.595 --> 37:15.025
What do you think
they're doing right now?


37:51.333 --> 37:53.393
- Are you all right?
- I'm fine.


37:54.703 --> 37:56.563
Please pull up here!


37:57.173 --> 37:58.233
Why?


37:58.841 --> 38:00.461
I'll get off first.


38:01.510 --> 38:02.840
No, let me.


39:06.041 --> 39:08.331
- Mrs. Chan!
- Ah Ping! You're back?


39:09.245 --> 39:10.235
Visiting Mr. Chow?


39:10.446 --> 39:13.146
Yes, I thought we'd have lunch.
But he isn't well.


39:13.349 --> 39:14.379
What's wrong with him?


39:14.583 --> 39:16.743
He's got a fever. He's all alone.


39:17.119 --> 39:19.559
So I'm gonna buy him
something to eat.


39:20.222 --> 39:21.682
The congee downstairs
is quite good.


39:21.890 --> 39:23.480
He doesn't want congee.


39:23.926 --> 39:25.516
What does he want?


39:25.761 --> 39:28.021
Can't taste anything,
so he wants sesame syrup.


39:28.230 --> 39:29.590
Damned troublesome!


39:35.371 --> 39:37.101
Amah!


39:37.606 --> 39:40.206
Mrs. Suen, she's hanging
the washing on the roof.


39:40.576 --> 39:41.606
Oh, you're back.


39:41.810 --> 39:43.100
Yes... You've been out?


39:43.312 --> 39:46.712
My mother's birthday is coming up.


39:47.116 --> 39:48.916
So I took her to buy some fabric.


39:49.118 --> 39:51.178
It took all day. I'm half dead!


39:51.654 --> 39:53.784
And I had my hair done.
Is it nice?


39:53.989 --> 39:55.049
Very nice!


39:55.257 --> 39:56.887
What are you cooking?


39:57.760 --> 40:00.380
I had a sudden craving
for sesame syrup.


40:00.829 --> 40:03.459
That whole pot is for you?


40:03.999 --> 40:06.399
I thought I might as well
make a potful.


40:07.169 --> 40:08.969
You're so thoughtful!


40:09.738 --> 40:11.538
- Please try it.
- I will.


40:12.675 --> 40:14.005
What a coincidence!


40:14.209 --> 40:15.839
Going out?


40:16.045 --> 40:19.175
I'll buy some noodles. I'm starving.


40:19.381 --> 40:20.811
Hungry? Will you join me?


40:22.117 --> 40:23.177
No thanks.


40:24.019 --> 40:25.579
Just off work?


40:25.788 --> 40:27.388
You must be very busy.


40:27.589 --> 40:31.029
Actually, I've been to see a picture.


40:31.794 --> 40:33.594
Really? How was it?


40:34.063 --> 40:34.823
So-so.


40:35.431 --> 40:37.391
I used to like
going to the pictures.


40:37.900 --> 40:39.690
You had many hobbies before.


40:39.902 --> 40:43.092
On your own,
you are free to do lots of things.


40:43.806 --> 40:45.676
Everything changes
when you marry.


40:46.075 --> 40:48.045
It must be decided together.


40:48.243 --> 40:49.333
Right?


40:52.247 --> 40:55.347
I sometimes wonder
what I'd be if I hadn't married.


40:55.951 --> 40:57.571
Have you ever thought of that?


41:00.122 --> 41:01.412
Maybe happier!


41:05.594 --> 41:08.464
I didn't know married life
would be so complicated!


41:09.832 --> 41:11.392
When you're single,


41:11.600 --> 41:13.530
you are only responsible
to yourself.


41:14.436 --> 41:16.406
Once you're married,


41:17.406 --> 41:19.736
doing well on your own
is not enough.


41:21.944 --> 41:25.974
Don't brood on it.
Maybe he'll be back soon.


41:29.752 --> 41:31.312
What about you?


41:31.520 --> 41:33.210
Actually, we're in the same boat.


41:36.658 --> 41:38.428
But I don't brood on it.


41:39.461 --> 41:41.151
It's not my fault.


41:41.964 --> 41:44.764
I can't waste time
wondering if I made mistakes.


41:44.967 --> 41:46.797
Life's too short for that.


41:48.137 --> 41:49.797
Something must change.


41:51.340 --> 41:53.000
So what's your plan?


41:54.710 --> 41:58.070
I want to write a martial-arts serial.


41:59.047 --> 42:02.277
Actually, I've started one.
I'll show it to you.


42:02.684 --> 42:03.654
Great!


42:04.653 --> 42:07.623
You like them too,
so why not help me write it?


42:07.823 --> 42:11.353
I wouldn't know how,
I only read them!


42:11.560 --> 42:13.750
We could discuss it together.


42:15.063 --> 42:16.823
All right, I'll try my best.


42:18.634 --> 42:20.464
I never thanked you
for the sesame syrup.


42:20.836 --> 42:24.106
There's no need,
I was making it anyway.


42:25.374 --> 42:28.934
Amazing! I was craving
some sesame syrup that day.


42:29.878 --> 42:31.818
Really? What a coincidence!


42:32.147 --> 42:33.637
It really was!


42:35.517 --> 42:36.717
I'll go for those noodles.


45:04.566 --> 45:07.366
Again! Halfway through dinner,
he's drunk! Disgusting!


45:07.569 --> 45:10.669
I told you to stop!
What can you do?


45:18.847 --> 45:19.837
It's me!


45:20.048 --> 45:21.488
You scared me.


45:21.683 --> 45:23.313
How's Mr. Koo?


45:23.652 --> 45:25.312
Drunk, as usual.


45:34.396 --> 45:36.296
I didn't expect them back so early!


45:38.900 --> 45:41.520
Since you're trapped here,
finish the noodles.


45:45.440 --> 45:47.230
They'll probably go soon.


45:58.286 --> 45:59.916
Want some soup?


46:03.025 --> 46:04.725
Want some soup?


46:16.104 --> 46:18.664
Mrs. Suen! Playing here tonight!


46:19.574 --> 46:22.204
Yes, Mrs. Koo is dealing
with her husband.


46:22.978 --> 46:25.208
I could do that.


46:25.414 --> 46:27.674
No, we should not trouble you.


46:28.784 --> 46:31.114
Think you'll play all night?


46:31.319 --> 46:34.049
No, we'll just play eight rounds.


46:38.627 --> 46:40.427
They'll play till morning?


46:41.496 --> 46:43.296
Mrs. Suen says only eight rounds.


46:44.066 --> 46:45.596
You believe that?


46:51.907 --> 46:55.137
You get some rest.
I'll wake you when they leave.


46:55.944 --> 46:57.104
And you?


46:57.412 --> 46:59.272
I have a chapter to finish.


47:13.128 --> 47:14.758
Where have you got to?


47:15.163 --> 47:17.093
The drunken master just showed up.


47:17.299 --> 47:18.969
When did he get written in?


47:20.135 --> 47:21.265
Just now!


47:44.559 --> 47:46.689
Mr. Chow, home so early?


47:46.895 --> 47:49.795
- I went out to buy some food.
- No work today?


47:49.998 --> 47:51.658
I don't feel so good,
I'm staying home.


47:51.867 --> 47:54.097
A sick man shouldn't eat
all that sticky rice.


47:54.402 --> 47:55.962
Some of it's for later.


47:56.171 --> 47:57.961
Don't stuff yourself!.


47:58.507 --> 47:59.377
Good morning!


47:59.574 --> 48:01.094
Good morning.
Finished your game?


48:01.309 --> 48:04.769
Not yet, but Mr. Yang has to work.


48:05.013 --> 48:06.673
Mr. Tsai is coming to replace him.


48:08.350 --> 48:10.340
Did you call the office for me?


48:10.685 --> 48:11.815
Yes.


48:12.053 --> 48:13.713
What did you tell them?


48:14.055 --> 48:15.715
That you weren't feeling well.


48:16.992 --> 48:18.782
Did they ask who you were?


48:18.994 --> 48:19.894
No.


48:23.265 --> 48:25.235
Probably took me for your husband.


48:26.201 --> 48:28.891
Mr. Ho knows that he's away.


48:29.404 --> 48:31.034
Pretend he's come back.


48:40.015 --> 48:41.715
Maybe we're being too cautious.


48:42.250 --> 48:44.080
I'm always round anyway.


48:44.286 --> 48:46.046
We shouldn't have panicked.


48:47.956 --> 48:51.056
Well, they did turn up
without warning.


48:51.259 --> 48:52.989
What would they assume?


48:56.231 --> 48:58.161
One can't put a foot wrong.


49:37.973 --> 49:38.943
You can go!


50:03.531 --> 50:06.121
- Amah!
- Mrs. Chan! You're back very late!


50:06.868 --> 50:08.768
I had a lot of work today.


50:09.204 --> 50:11.794
I didn't see you leave this morning.


50:12.007 --> 50:13.977
I had breakfast with my mother.


50:14.175 --> 50:15.835
You weren't here when I left.


50:17.445 --> 50:18.175
Where's Mrs. Suen?


50:18.380 --> 50:22.330
Asleep.
She played mahjong all day.


50:22.550 --> 50:24.670
- Be quiet, don't wake her.
- All right!


50:25.220 --> 50:27.010
Mrs. Chan, is your leg all right?


50:27.222 --> 50:29.282
It's these new shoes.


51:15.537 --> 51:17.597
Why a special dinner tonight?


51:18.173 --> 51:22.103
Since you won't take
your share of the writing fee...


51:23.611 --> 51:26.271
All I did was give you some thoughts.


51:27.482 --> 51:29.812
Someone else
is asking for a serial too.


51:30.185 --> 51:31.915
There'll be more work soon.


51:32.120 --> 51:35.920
Really? So quickly?
Isn't the workload too much?


51:36.191 --> 51:38.311
That's why
I'm looking for a new place.


51:39.227 --> 51:40.287
What for?


51:42.030 --> 51:43.190
To write in!


51:44.399 --> 51:46.339
It'll be more convenient.


51:47.035 --> 51:50.835
There's nothing between us,
but I don't want gossip.


51:52.841 --> 51:54.461
What do you think?


51:55.577 --> 51:57.477
Why waste money?


51:58.179 --> 52:02.379
You don't need me.
You can write on your own.


52:42.190 --> 52:44.090
Who do you want?


52:44.292 --> 52:45.982
Chow Mo-Wan?


52:46.261 --> 52:48.551
He hasn't been in for several days.


52:51.433 --> 52:53.333
We're looking for him too.


52:55.303 --> 52:57.563
May I know who's calling?


53:00.208 --> 53:01.838
Any message?


53:03.812 --> 53:05.902
It's no trouble. Good-bye.


53:18.393 --> 53:20.413
Please get this to Accounts.


53:20.628 --> 53:23.098
And have the air-conditioner
serviced tomorrow.


53:23.431 --> 53:24.361
Mr. Ho!


53:25.967 --> 53:28.197
No need to stay
if everything's done.


53:28.403 --> 53:30.063
- I'll lock up.
- Yes.


53:42.150 --> 53:43.200
Hello?


53:48.656 --> 53:50.286
Where are you?


54:54.288 --> 54:55.988
I'll come again tomorrow.


54:56.791 --> 54:59.081
No need.
I'll be all right after some rest.


55:00.194 --> 55:01.924
It's no trouble.


55:02.797 --> 55:05.357
I'll bring you some food.
What would you like?


55:05.800 --> 55:06.990
Whatever.


55:07.769 --> 55:10.539
Then I'll leave now. Get some rest.


55:10.805 --> 55:12.535
Call me when you get home.


55:13.040 --> 55:15.900
Let it ring three times,
then hang up.


55:16.811 --> 55:17.431
All right.


55:24.952 --> 55:26.682
I didn't think you'd come.


55:30.725 --> 55:32.525
We won't be like them.


55:34.328 --> 55:35.358
See you tomorrow.


57:51.832 --> 57:53.562
Tell me honestly...


57:56.437 --> 57:58.237
do you have a mistress?


58:01.008 --> 58:02.638
You're crazy!


58:05.513 --> 58:07.143
Who told you I had?


58:07.381 --> 58:09.001
Never mind who.


58:09.951 --> 58:11.641
Do you or don't you?


58:14.355 --> 58:15.375
No.


58:20.928 --> 58:22.588
Don't lie!


58:23.965 --> 58:25.725
Look at me.


58:30.705 --> 58:33.035
I'm asking you,
do you have a mistress?


58:37.712 --> 58:38.672
Yes!


58:44.885 --> 58:46.585
That's no reaction!


58:47.622 --> 58:51.922
If he admits it outright,
let him have it!


58:55.663 --> 58:58.063
I wasn't expecting
he would admit it so easily.


58:59.967 --> 59:01.597
I didn't know how to react!


59:03.904 --> 59:05.094
One more time, all right?


59:23.024 --> 59:24.954
Tell me frankly.


59:26.160 --> 59:27.950
Do you have a mistress?


59:31.799 --> 59:33.139
You're crazy!


59:38.706 --> 59:40.336
Who told you that?


59:41.876 --> 59:45.146
Never mind that.
Do you or don't you?


59:50.685 --> 59:51.745
No.


59:54.388 --> 59:56.018
Don't lie!


59:56.524 --> 59:58.254
Tell me!


59:59.393 --> 01:00:00.653
Look at me.


01:00:01.295 --> 01:00:02.855
Do you have a mistress?


01:00:12.406 --> 01:00:13.336
Yes!


01:00:40.101 --> 01:00:41.721
Are you all right?


01:00:45.206 --> 01:00:47.476
I didn't expect it to hurt so much.


01:00:56.917 --> 01:00:59.477
This is just a rehearsal.


01:01:02.923 --> 01:01:05.053
He won't really admit it so readily.


01:01:05.626 --> 01:01:09.066
It's all right. Don't take it so hard.


01:01:13.801 --> 01:01:15.961
You've been out a lot lately.


01:01:16.203 --> 01:01:17.263
Yes.


01:01:19.473 --> 01:01:23.273
It's right to enjoy yourself
while you're young.


01:01:24.211 --> 01:01:26.141
But don't overdo it.


01:01:29.183 --> 01:01:31.083
When will your husband be back?


01:01:31.619 --> 01:01:33.249
Soon!


01:01:34.388 --> 01:01:38.658
In future,
don't let him travel so much.


01:01:39.460 --> 01:01:42.820
A couple should spend time
together.


01:01:43.731 --> 01:01:45.491
Don't you agree?


01:01:47.668 --> 01:01:48.698
Good night.


01:02:10.724 --> 01:02:12.454
Will you come over tonight?


01:02:12.927 --> 01:02:14.187
What for?


01:02:14.395 --> 01:02:16.955
The editor's hounding me.
He says I'm too slow.


01:02:17.164 --> 01:02:19.464
I need your help.
When can you come?


01:02:20.601 --> 01:02:22.831
Not anytime soon.


01:02:23.504 --> 01:02:24.834
Why not?


01:02:25.506 --> 01:02:28.306
Mrs. Suen lectured me last night.


01:02:28.676 --> 01:02:30.236
What did she say?


01:02:30.444 --> 01:02:32.074
Rather not say.


01:02:32.413 --> 01:02:34.843
We shouldn't see so much
of each other.


01:02:46.026 --> 01:02:48.756
Mrs. Chan,
going out for noodles again?


01:02:49.029 --> 01:02:52.899
Not tonight.
I'll make myself something.


01:02:53.767 --> 01:02:59.837
Join us.
We're having vegetable won-tons!


01:03:00.107 --> 01:03:01.167
All right.


01:05:33.227 --> 01:05:35.057
- No lunch today, Mr. Ho?
- No.


01:05:36.797 --> 01:05:39.167
A Mr. Chow just called for you.


01:05:39.400 --> 01:05:41.230
He wants you to call him back.


01:05:44.405 --> 01:05:45.375
Thank you.


01:06:18.405 --> 01:06:20.565
- Back from work?
- Yes.


01:06:22.443 --> 01:06:25.073
- Strange weather!
- Isn't it?


01:06:25.746 --> 01:06:27.306
Been here long?


01:06:27.514 --> 01:06:29.144
Just a while.


01:06:31.251 --> 01:06:33.041
I don't think it'll stop soon.


01:06:35.255 --> 01:06:36.245
Wait for me.


01:07:05.052 --> 01:07:06.672
I'll see you home.


01:07:07.154 --> 01:07:10.524
We'd better not be seen together.


01:07:12.226 --> 01:07:14.096
Then you go first.


01:07:16.163 --> 01:07:17.853
If they see your umbrella...


01:07:18.065 --> 01:07:20.465
they'll know I was with you.


01:07:22.870 --> 01:07:24.530
I wasn't thinking.


01:07:28.075 --> 01:07:31.205
You go first, I'll wait a while.


01:07:33.347 --> 01:07:35.047
I'll keep you company.


01:07:57.037 --> 01:07:58.737
Did you try to call me?


01:08:00.874 --> 01:08:03.244
I wasn't sure you got the message.


01:08:04.077 --> 01:08:06.067
Could you get me a boat ticket?


01:08:08.282 --> 01:08:10.072
To where?


01:08:11.451 --> 01:08:13.681
Ah Ping wrote from Singapore.


01:08:14.021 --> 01:08:17.541
They're short of staff.
He'd like me to go and help.


01:08:21.695 --> 01:08:23.395
How long will you stay?


01:08:23.597 --> 01:08:26.197
Don't know. I'll play it by ear.


01:08:31.371 --> 01:08:33.361
Why rush off to Singapore?


01:08:35.309 --> 01:08:37.009
A change of scene.


01:08:38.879 --> 01:08:40.779
I've had enough of the gossip.


01:08:42.616 --> 01:08:44.706
We know it's not true,
so why worry?


01:08:48.722 --> 01:08:53.092
I used to think that too,
and it didn't worry me.


01:08:56.763 --> 01:08:58.753
I thought we wouldn't be like them.


01:09:03.136 --> 01:09:04.796
But I was wrong.


01:09:07.674 --> 01:09:09.734
You won't leave your husband.


01:09:12.479 --> 01:09:14.209
So I'd rather go away.


01:09:21.188 --> 01:09:23.718
I didn't think
you'd fall in love with me.


01:09:24.825 --> 01:09:26.625
I didn't either.


01:09:31.832 --> 01:09:34.262
I was only curious
to know how it started.


01:09:35.369 --> 01:09:37.069
Now I know.


01:09:38.839 --> 01:09:40.899
Feelings can creep up just like that.


01:09:45.045 --> 01:09:46.805
I thought I was in control.


01:09:47.848 --> 01:09:50.338
But I hate to think
of your husband coming home.


01:09:51.451 --> 01:09:52.911
I wish he'd stay away!


01:09:54.688 --> 01:09:56.178
I'm so bad!


01:10:00.060 --> 01:10:01.920
Will you do me one favor?


01:10:03.163 --> 01:10:04.153
What?


01:10:05.732 --> 01:10:07.492
I want to be prepared.


01:11:04.257 --> 01:11:06.247
You'd better not see me again.


01:11:11.365 --> 01:11:13.165
Is your husband back?


01:11:14.201 --> 01:11:15.161
Yes.


01:11:17.437 --> 01:11:19.097
Am I hopeless?


01:11:21.441 --> 01:11:22.841
Not really.


01:11:33.253 --> 01:11:35.013
I won't see you again.


01:11:37.491 --> 01:11:39.351
Keep a closer eye on your husband.


01:12:20.000 --> 01:12:21.760
Please.


01:12:22.969 --> 01:12:25.139
Don't be serious,
it's only a rehearsal.


01:12:26.606 --> 01:12:27.976
Don't cry!


01:12:32.479 --> 01:12:34.149
This isn't real.


01:13:24.431 --> 01:13:26.291
I don't want to go home tonight.


01:13:53.026 --> 01:13:57.486
Mei-Yi wants to dedicate a song
to her honeymooning friends.


01:13:57.697 --> 01:14:02.497
And Mrs. Cheung wishes the best
to her neighbors.


01:14:03.203 --> 01:14:05.603
And Mr. Chan,
now on business in Japan,


01:14:05.805 --> 01:14:11.765
wants to wish his wife
a happy birthday.


01:14:12.045 --> 01:14:16.885
So let's all enjoy Zhou Xuan
singing in "Full Bloom".


01:15:57.851 --> 01:15:59.011
It's me.


01:16:00.587 --> 01:16:02.317
If there's an extra ticket...


01:16:03.523 --> 01:16:04.953
would you go with me?


01:18:33.573 --> 01:18:34.933
It's me.


01:18:36.042 --> 01:18:38.162
If there's an extra ticket...


01:18:38.545 --> 01:18:40.475
would you go with me?


01:18:52.091 --> 01:18:54.651
SINGAPORE, 1963.


01:18:57.197 --> 01:18:59.297
Mr. Chow has gone to work.


01:19:00.166 --> 01:19:01.966
Any message?


01:19:03.369 --> 01:19:04.999
You're welcome!


01:19:35.034 --> 01:19:36.624
Has anyone been in my room?


01:19:36.836 --> 01:19:37.766
No.


01:19:38.204 --> 01:19:39.504
Something's missing.


01:19:39.839 --> 01:19:40.899
What?


01:20:11.304 --> 01:20:12.434
In the old days...


01:20:13.940 --> 01:20:19.240
if someone had a secret
they didn't want to share...


01:20:19.846 --> 01:20:21.576
you know what they did?


01:20:22.482 --> 01:20:24.272
Have no idea.


01:20:27.720 --> 01:20:29.680
They went up a mountain,
found a tree...


01:20:31.791 --> 01:20:33.481
carved a hole in it...


01:20:34.294 --> 01:20:36.264
and whispered the secret
into the hole.


01:20:37.463 --> 01:20:39.593
Then they covered it with mud.


01:20:41.367 --> 01:20:45.467
And leave the secret there forever.


01:20:47.707 --> 01:20:51.807
What a pain!
I'd just go to get laid.


01:20:55.081 --> 01:20:56.741
Not everyone's like you!


01:20:58.284 --> 01:21:02.114
I'm just an average guy.
I don't have secrets like you.


01:21:02.555 --> 01:21:05.385
You bottle things up!


01:21:05.591 --> 01:21:07.421
Tell me something!


01:21:07.994 --> 01:21:09.684
I don't have secrets.


01:21:11.331 --> 01:21:13.421
Come off it, buddy!


01:21:14.434 --> 01:21:16.164
I won't tell anyone.


01:23:44.250 --> 01:23:45.910
Hello, Singapore Daily.


01:23:46.586 --> 01:23:47.916
Hold on.


01:23:48.988 --> 01:23:50.758
Mr. Chow, call for you.


01:23:51.090 --> 01:23:52.110
Thanks!


01:23:55.261 --> 01:23:56.121
Hello?


01:24:02.235 --> 01:24:03.205
Hello?


01:24:52.051 --> 01:24:54.951
- Who is it?
- It's me.


01:24:55.655 --> 01:24:58.625
- Mrs. Chan, long time no see!
- Yes.


01:24:59.358 --> 01:25:01.258
- Amah, who's there?
- Mrs. Suen!


01:25:01.460 --> 01:25:03.480
What brings you here?


01:25:03.696 --> 01:25:05.426
It's been a while.


01:25:05.631 --> 01:25:09.081
I was nearby so I thought
I'd bring your boat ticket.


01:25:09.802 --> 01:25:10.792
And a small gift.


01:25:11.003 --> 01:25:14.303
You shouldn't have.
It's nice just to see you.


01:25:15.007 --> 01:25:16.167
The place is in such a mess!


01:25:16.375 --> 01:25:17.535
Already started packing?


01:25:17.743 --> 01:25:24.203
It's hopeless.
I can't bear to throw things away!


01:25:25.918 --> 01:25:27.618
Let's find you a seat.


01:25:31.724 --> 01:25:33.524
- Have some tea!
- Thank you!


01:25:34.160 --> 01:25:38.390
Eat with us, Mrs. Chan!
I'm going to the market.


01:25:40.099 --> 01:25:43.229
I can't. I have work waiting.


01:25:43.869 --> 01:25:45.839
Don't rush off!.


01:25:46.339 --> 01:25:50.839
Mrs. Suen will be upset
if you don't eat here.


01:25:51.611 --> 01:25:53.571
Amah, pour me some tea too.


01:25:55.181 --> 01:25:56.801
How's your husband?


01:25:57.016 --> 01:25:58.646
He's fine, thank you.


01:25:58.751 --> 01:26:00.371
How long will you be away?


01:26:00.586 --> 01:26:02.216
I don't know.


01:26:02.421 --> 01:26:05.011
If I like it, I might stay!


01:26:05.825 --> 01:26:06.985
Why?


01:26:07.260 --> 01:26:12.960
My daughter worries
about the situation in Hong Kong.


01:26:13.165 --> 01:26:15.995
I don't want to leave.


01:26:16.235 --> 01:26:22.295
Since the Koos left, I don't have
my mahjong partners anymore.


01:26:22.775 --> 01:26:28.375
And my daughter needs help
with her kids in the US.


01:26:31.684 --> 01:26:33.314
What about this place?


01:26:34.186 --> 01:26:36.316
I'm not sure...


01:26:37.923 --> 01:26:39.983
I don't want to sell it.


01:26:41.794 --> 01:26:43.814
So I might rent it out.


01:26:44.930 --> 01:26:46.650
How much would you want?


01:26:47.933 --> 01:26:49.663
You're interested?


01:26:49.869 --> 01:26:54.329
You could have it at a discount.


01:26:54.573 --> 01:26:56.163
I'll think about it.


01:26:56.375 --> 01:26:57.865
Mrs. Suen, your tea!


01:26:59.312 --> 01:27:01.712
Who lives next door now?


01:27:02.114 --> 01:27:08.454
I don't really know them.


01:27:08.821 --> 01:27:14.851
The Koos were almost like family!


01:27:16.295 --> 01:27:19.385
It was so nice then, wasn't it?


01:27:20.099 --> 01:27:21.039
Yes.


01:27:22.668 --> 01:27:24.298
Let's sit over here.


01:27:50.863 --> 01:27:51.833
Yes?


01:27:52.031 --> 01:27:53.361
Is Mr. Koo in?


01:27:53.566 --> 01:27:56.196
He moved long ago.


01:27:56.869 --> 01:27:58.499
Do you know where he is?


01:27:59.505 --> 01:28:01.165
You know him well?


01:28:01.741 --> 01:28:03.431
I used to live here.


01:28:04.710 --> 01:28:06.430
Is Mrs. Suen still next door?


01:28:06.846 --> 01:28:11.806
She's gone! It's too chaotic.
Everyone's running away.


01:28:12.818 --> 01:28:14.548
So who lives there now?


01:28:15.054 --> 01:28:19.514
A woman and her son.


01:28:19.725 --> 01:28:21.525
The kid is cute.


01:28:24.430 --> 01:28:29.020
No address in the Philippines.
Just his son's phone number.


01:28:32.571 --> 01:28:36.331
- I can't accept this!
- Please, you must.


01:28:36.709 --> 01:28:38.379
Thank you, then.


01:28:49.688 --> 01:28:51.318
That era has passed.


01:28:51.557 --> 01:28:54.357
Nothing that belonged to it
exists any more.


01:28:55.294 --> 01:28:56.814
Are you ready?


01:28:57.029 --> 01:28:58.899
- Okay!
- Let's go!


01:29:11.243 --> 01:29:14.703
CAMBODIA, 1966


01:29:14.880 --> 01:29:19.570
The presidential corps waits
at Pochentong Airport...


01:29:19.985 --> 01:29:24.285
Prince Norodom Sihanouk
and Queen Sisowath Kossamak...


01:29:24.990 --> 01:29:26.710
come forward
to greet General De Gaulle.


01:29:33.799 --> 01:29:38.759
It's ten kilometers
from Pochentong to Phnom Penh.


01:29:39.939 --> 01:29:42.539
200,000 people line the route.


01:29:42.741 --> 01:29:45.071
A welcome unprecedented
in the history of the kingdom.


01:33:20.526 --> 01:33:23.586
He remembers those vanished years.


01:33:23.796 --> 01:33:27.596
As though looking through
a dusty window pane,


01:33:27.800 --> 01:33:31.930
the past is something he could see,
but not touch.


01:33:32.137 --> 01:33:36.637
And everything he sees
is blurred and indistinct.


01:33:41.480 --> 01:33:46.500
End


01:33:48.887 --> 01:33:51.047
Special thanks:


01:33:51.256 --> 01:33:54.056
